; M1 Carbine placeholder viewmodel, assembled from primitives.
; Local space: barrel fires along -Z, +Y up. Roughly life-size (~0.90m long).
;
; Sight line runs at y=0.068, clear of the receiver, handguard, barrel band and
; the operating slide handle -- the handle sits on the right flank rather than
; on top, which is where it would block the aperture.
